    "title": "Tractor-trailer crash knocks out power on southbound side of James River Bridge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 days ago CARROLLTON, Virginia — Virginia State police are investigating a single-vehicle tractor-trailer crash that knocked power out to parts of the James River Bridge. State police said on Monday around 8:13 p.m., they were called to southbound Route 17 just north of the Raceway gas station in Isle of Wight County. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
